        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 35</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Cristenum mannan gebirað swiðe rihte þæt he Godes abilgðe wrece swiðe georne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">It is the duty most incumbent upon a Christian man that he should avenge offences against God with the utmost diligence.</ab>
